<title>USA: NB Capital IV sets $500 mln in capital securities.</title>
<headline>NB Capital IV sets $500 mln in capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following $500 million</p>
<p>issue from NB Capital Trust IV, a wholly owned trust of</p>
<p>NationsBank Corp's Nationsbanc Capital Markets Inc, priced</p>
<p>on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER  NB Capital IV</p>
<p>AMT $500 MLN	  COUPON  8.25	MATURITY 04/15/27</p>
<p>TYPE CAP SECURITIES ISS PRICE 99.453  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1     YIELD   8.30	PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P   A-MINUS  SPREAD  118 BP    CALLABLE 10</p>
<p>			  OVER 6-1/2'S OF 2026</p>
<p>((  U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1675))</p>
</text>
